# a track the hand plays and nobody hears: the screen says why (muted in the part, another's solo, VOL 0, a curve on VOL)
wait 300
turn SELECT -1
wait 100
expect track 1
tap PLAY
wait 500
key w0 down 100
wait 400
expect why 0
key w0 up
wait 300
setpmask 0 2
key w0 down 100
wait 400
expect why 2
key w0 up
wait 300
setpmask 0 0
setsolo 0 1
key w0 down 100
wait 400
expect why 3
key w0 up
setsolo 0 0
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 100
expect page 11
turn K1 -100 10
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
key w0 down 100
wait 400
expect why 5
key w0 up
tap PLAY
